      "text": "http : / / www . sott . net / article / 263487 - Powerful - 6 - 1 - magnitude - earthquake - injures - dozens - in - Indonesias - Aceh - province Powerful <17 6 . 1 magnitude earthquake> <18 injures> dozens in Indonesia's Aceh province Tue , 02 Jul 2013 12 : 28 CDT A powerful <1 6 . 1 magnitude earthquake> <2 hit> Indonesia's northwestern Aceh province , on the island of Sumatra . Dozens have been <21 reported> <9 injured> . The epicenter of the <3 quake> was roughly 55 kilometers from the town of Bireuen , a regency of the larger Aceh province , and <7 took place> at 7 : 37 AM local time <20 according to> data from the US Geological Survey . Although it's unknown how many were injured , Sky News estimates\"at least 50 people , \" and numerous buildings have collapsed as an effect of the powerful tremblor . The <4 quake> appears to have <5 shaken> the provincial capital of Banda Aceh , which is located at the northern tip of the Sumatran land mass . \"I <19 see> many houses were <6 damaged> and their roofs <8 fell onto> some people , \" <22 said> central Aceh district resident Bensu Elianita to the Associated Press . \"Many people were <10 injured> but it is <23 difficult> to <11 evacuate> them due to <12 traffic jams> . \" \"We have received around 50 people with injuries suffered when the walls of their houses collapsed , \" said doctor Ema Suryani to AFP , speaking from Lampahan city in Aceh's Bener Meriah district . Aceh was <13 hit> extremely hard by the massive <14 \"Boxing Day\" earthquake> and <15 tsunami> in 2004 , <16 killing> 170 , 000 people in Sumatra alone - with 35 , 000 bodies never <43 recovered> . The rebuilding process continues to this day from the enormous natural disaster .",
